                            <property name="text">
                             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;How to define values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Left side: Raster value (e.g. 0 or 1)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Right side: ENVI-met ID (e.g. 0200H2 for 2m Hedges)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Assignment operator: -&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;Use max. one assignment per row!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Other&amp;quot;-keyword: Each unassigned value will be filled with the ENVI-met ID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;assigned to &amp;quot;Other&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If &amp;quot;Other&amp;quot; is not assigned, each unassigned value remains empty&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(No Simple plants - coverage). &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                            </property>
