                         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Defines how the lateral model borders are handled numerically. &amp;quot;Open&amp;quot; copies the values of the next&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;grid point close to the border back to the border for each time step, which may overestimate the&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;influence of the environment near the border. &amp;quot;Cyclic&amp;quot; describes the process of copying the values of&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;the downstream border to the upstream border.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
